what An awk LCG whose multiplier times its modulus passes 2^53 is a rounded shadow of the generator its own comment names, and awk carries every number as a double. Measured on metal: torus_fold_control.sh:60 spells seed*1103515245 % 2147483648, whose product reaches 2.4e18; the rounded map reaches 13,720 distinct states -- a tail of 3,254 and a period of 10,466 -- against the exact generator's 2^31, and its consumed byte differs from the exact stream in 4,079 of 4,096 draws, diverging at draw 2. Five tracked LCG sites stand across four files and the tree already wrote its own safe spelling twice, in aurora_placement_scan.sh and topology_growth_scan.sh, each naming this exact arithmetic -- so two later pens reached past a reason already written down, which is a lantern on its third firing. Repair the torus site to MINSTD, and seat a scan reading every tracked awk LCG that computes multiplier times modulus-minus-one and holds the unsafe count under a ceiling that only falls, reporting the two key_trade sites and the one discarded workload site rather than repairing another lane's statistical bands.
